        <p>Why are some Yellow Sapphires suspiciously cheap? Almost always: diffusion treatment or glass filling, irradiation with unstable colour, substitution with Citrine or Yellow Topaz, or misrepresented origin. True Yellow Sapphire value lives in natural character, colour stability, and complete transparency.</p>
